{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月24日，高盛科技、媒體及電信（TMT）專業銷售交易團隊在最新報告中指出，黃仁勳重返英偉達消除了近期半導體行業最緊迫的管理層不確定性，但並不意味着壓制晶片股的風險因素已經出清。當前板塊反彈可能受到市場情緒改善及空頭回補的推動，而行業估值能否持續修復，仍取決於融資環境、AI基礎設施建設及企業盈利表現。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587848.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T15:24:02.831518+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T15:11:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T15:17:14.923105+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T15:17:14.923105+00:00","content_hash":"3e6265d7d138dbedeeb0ae071e6cb9fae346ac4a3f28e9c693e2fc84ac80f230","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}